# Badang, Tribal Warrior

> Badang is a punishment fighter, not a blind engage hero. He wins when Fist Break turns terrain into a cage, Fist Crack keeps the target pinned, and attack-effect items make every punch matter. If the enemy draft can dash, purify, or suppress that channel on demand, the pick becomes a coin flip before the first wave even meets.

